<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Gift Voucher Credited – AnyLicence</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:20px 0;">


  <!-- Main Container -->
  <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-collapse:collapse;">

    <!-- Header -->
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color:#3a3a3a; padding:15px 30px 5px;">
        <img style="width:140px;" src="https://static.anylicence.com/media/statics/logo.png" alt="AnyLicence" />
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Body -->
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:25px 30px; color:#333333; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">

        <p><strong>Hi {{recipientName}},</strong></p>

        <p>
          🎉 <strong>Great news — your Gift Voucher has been successfully credited to your AnyLicence wallet.</strong>
        </p>

        <p><strong>Voucher Details:</strong></p>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:20px; font-size:14px;">
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Amount:</strong></td>
            <td>${{amount}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Voucher Code:</strong></td>
            <td><strong>{{voucherCode}}</strong></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Credited On:</strong></td>
            <td>{{creditedAt}}</td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <p>
          You can now use your voucher balance to book lessons, tests, or training sessions across AnyLicence.
        </p>

        <p>
          To view your wallet balance or make a booking, simply log in to your dashboard.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you have any questions, our support team is here to help at 
          <a href="mailto:support@anylicence.com.au" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
            support@anylicence.com.au
          </a>.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Team AnyLicence</strong><br/>
          <a href="https://www.anylicence.com.au" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
            www.anylicence.com.au
          </a>
        </p>

      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color:#ffb300; height:5px;"></td>
    </tr>

  </table>

</td>

  </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
